      "value": "Found ANOTHER fix for this that I doubt will work on repeated attempts. Set it to a toggle, and then back to a button. I don't know why that worked, but the bug happened again, and this time, that was the fix. Why? I have no idea. I'm just glad the avatar I was just working on finally works. What even is this SDK anymore?",
